## 10. Performance and fallback
- Render only when the tab is visible (`document.hidden` pauses the loop) and when the interior view is closed.
- Phones: pixel ratio max 1.5, shadow map 1024, palms ≤ 30, no water reflections (use the fallback water material), neighbours ≤ 8.
